{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102369","id":2827740197,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6J3JuM","number":102369,"title":"Optimize `String::get_data` by avoiding a dereference of ptr, and inlining the function.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-02-03T14:51:04Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T09:02:41Z","closed_at":"2025-06-02T23:59:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102369","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102369","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102369.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102369.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-02T23:59:29Z"},"body":"I have just profiled 'extremely long' text editing: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101882#issuecomment-2631165014\r\n\r\nOne thing that surprised me was that `String::get_data` took an observable role at 1.3% (0.2s in the profiled case). This warrants optimizing it.\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\n**size()**\r\nThe current implementation (effectively `size() ? ptr() : &_null`) forces the compiler to fetch the size from RAM. While it is unlikely that `get_data` is called without accessing the data afterwards, it _is_ likely that the data is accessed somewhere deeper in the array (not at the start where `size` is located), and thus the fetch to `size` may require a separate RAM fetch anyway. `String` guarantees that 0-size strings use `nullptr` semantics, thus fetching size is not actually necessary. I have used the same trick to optimize the `is_empty()` implementation (`CowData` / `Vector` already use this trick).\r\n\r\n**inline**\r\nNot inlining `get_data()` forces the compiler to generate a blackbox call (possibly unless `LTO` is used), which actually generates _more_ code (due to call semantics) than the inlined code may generate ([proof on GodBolt](https://godbolt.org/z/sYEb8xT83)). It is therefore warranted to expose the implementation to the header file, and allow it to be inlined.\r\nIn particular, the inline may allow the compiler to omit the `if` clause if `ptr` has already been established to be non-null at some earlier time.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}